{"publicId":"22389cc6-2cd5-456d-adef-d8a4b1d04ee1","title":"PayPal上调2026年盈利指引至5.60美元，Q3交易量增长7.3%超预期","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-03T21:36:08.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-03T21:36:08.000Z","digest":"PayPal在2026年第三季度宣布将全年调整后每股收益预期从5.38美元上调至5.60美元，并确认Q3支付交易量同比增长7.3%至68亿笔，超市场预期。调整依据为跨境支付和商家服务业务的积极数据，早前指引发布于2025年财报【新】。\n\n财报显示，PayPal通过股票回购削减了约9%的流通股（从920百万股降至837百万股），回购金额达1.5亿美元，全年回购目标60亿美元。此举使调整后每股收益同比增长8%至1.45美元，但调整后净利润同比下降3%【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T15:42:11.125Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Block Q3财报超预期并上调全年指引","latestReport":{"id":"gzd5qxhhv6n2fvdg2tyy8qd1a"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fiT4qOlUNNVk","title":"Block Q3 earnings beat and raised full-year guidance","firstReportAt":"2026-11-03T21:36:08.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"gzd5qxhhv6n2fvdg2tyy8qd1a","title":"Block Q3财报超预期并上调全年指引","summary":"Block（NYSE:XYZ）2026年第三季度财报显示：调整后每股收益$1.13超分析师预期$1.02，GAAP净利润$5.656亿（$0.92/股），收入$67.2亿超预期$66.2亿。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T21:36:08.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"gzd5qxhhv6n2fvdg2tyy8qd1a","title":"Block Q3财报超预期并上调全年指引","summary":"Block（NYSE:XYZ）2026年第三季度财报显示：调整后每股收益$1.13超分析师预期$1.02，GAAP净利润$5.656亿（$0.92/股），收入$67.2亿超预期$66.2亿。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T21:36:08.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T20:00:00.000Z","heat":3.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T21:00:00.000Z","heat":3.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T22:00:00.000Z","heat":3.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"202